Description:
The MAC-10 is a cheap, mass-produceable compact submachinegun, on the same vein of weapons like the STEN or the Uzi.
It's not the sleekest, but it's boxy design has a certain charm to it, and it's size and weight makes it very easy to dual-wield.
While it's firerate and capacity are excellent, it's accuracy (especially it's accuracy) and reload speed are not, and it's ammo consumption is off the charts.
But so is it's style. Right below red aviators and black trenchcoats.